    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n103194" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τερσαίνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dry up</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἷμα μέλαν τέρσηνε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					16.529
				</span></i>
			: pres. in <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				390
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				551
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be dried up</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυῖαι τερσαίνοντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.1405
				</span></i>
			; <i>to be dried</i>, of figs, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				180
			</span></i>: cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέρσομαι</span>.</div>
